Correlative Mn-Co catalyst excels Pt in oxygen reduction reaction of quasi-solid-state zinc-air batteries
Tingting Wang1,  Jincheng Huang1,  Wei Sang2,  Cai Zhou1,  Bohan Zhang1,  Wei Zhu1,  Kang ${\sf D}{\sf u}^{1}$ ,  Zongkui Kou2 $(\Join)$ , and Shengxiang Wang1 $(\Join)$
